<title>USA: PureTec Corp Q2 Jan 31 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>PureTec Corp Q2 Jan 31 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>RIDGEFIELD, N.J. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>CONSOLIDATED STATEMENT  OF OPERATIONS</p>
<p>(Dollars and shares in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						     Three months ended</p>
<p>						 Jan 31,	    Jan 31,</p>
<p>						 1997		1996 (1)</p>
<p> NET SALES				 $  66,431	  $  73,053</p>
